        <div class="hidden mt-3 text-white/80">The dry season, from April to November, typically offers the best conditions with calm, clear, and warm waters (around 27-29°C). However, Bali's east coast, particularly Amed and Tulamben, is sheltered and offers great freediving conditions year-round.</div>
